; FARO - NPC field sprites, 8x16 mode, 3 looks x 16 tiles (GDD 7.2): DOWN, UP, SIDE, SIDE_STEP per look.
; Frame base F: left pair F, F+1; right pair F+2, F+3. Walking down/up = the frame flipped X on alternate steps;
; left = SIDE frames flipped X. Looks: ABUELA (Tomasa, older folk: grey bun, shawl, apron),
; PESCADOR (fishermen, shopkeeper: knit cap, beard, striped jersey), VECINA (nurse, villagers: headscarf).
; 48 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

